1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,847
Two weeks before the date, the machine stopped.

2
00:00:02,847 --> 00:00:09,175
A statement from Y-G, brief as a telegram: AH-hyun would not participate in the debut.

3
00:00:09,175 --> 00:00:11,108
Health and recovery first.

4
00:00:11,108 --> 00:00:13,956
No timeline offered, because there wasn't one.

5
00:00:13,956 --> 00:00:17,396
The comments under a debut teaser turned into a vigil.

